{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "58f22161-72ea-8823-a26a-2afaf1fddc88",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T12:59:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diane Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:50:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:51:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. Um, this is Diane Fiore. Can you hear me all right? I've got you on the speaker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:51:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine, Diane. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:51:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. I'm calling about the water. On the street. Down at the corner by my house, it's still sitting there from the storm. The one that ended Saturday. [pause] Two days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still standing two days after. Where abouts are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty-six Marsh Street. Down the Point. Near the corner, where the, the crosswalk is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:51:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty-six Marsh Street, okay. And the water is at the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:51:49-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It goes right across the crosswalk. Right where the school bus stops. The children wait there in the morning and, and they can't stand on the corner because it's all water. So they step out into the road to get around it. Out where the cars come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:52:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good. How deep is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:52:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well. [pause] I watched a car go through this morning. It was up to the hubcaps. About that. Yes, the hubcaps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:52:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps. Okay. And is the drain right there at the corner, do you know? Can you see it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:52:37-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't see it. That's the thing. It's under the water. There's a little bit of leaves, I think, I saw some leaves on top. Or, or sticks. [line breaks up] I'm sorry, where was I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:52:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You were saying leaves or sticks over the drain. That's fine. That helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:53:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Leaves. It's, well, it's just annoying, you know. It's the same thing every time we have weather. It sits and sits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:53:12-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Let me get this down properly so a crew can look at it. Marsh Street at the crosswalk by the bus stop, a drain blocked or not draining, water across the crosswalk about hubcap deep, and kids stepping into the roadway. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:53:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. That's all of it. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:53:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Is it the corner nearest your house, or is it down toward the water end of the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nearest my house. Um, the one just up from me. I can see it from my front window. [pause] I'm in the front room now, actually. That's where I keep the phone. And my ukulele."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:54:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your ukulele?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:54:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Yes. I'm learning it. From the videos. On the, the computer. My neighbor set it up. I'm not very good yet. I only know three chords. [pause] Sorry. That's not what you need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's nice, good for you. Three chords gets you a lot of songs. Now, let me ask, is the water on the sidewalk too, or just the street and crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:54:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. The sidewalk too, by the corner. That's why the children go in the road. They'd get their shoes soaked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:54:47-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Okay, I'm going to put this in as a priority because of the bus stop. What's a good number for you, in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four oh one, five five five, oh one five five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-five. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Now, will you open a, a work order? Is that what it's called? I was told that once. That there's a work order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's what I'm doing now. I'll open one for this drain and the standing water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:30-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And for what date? Will it say a date? When they will come. I'd like to know the date. Because I called, well, I didn't call this time, but it's always, they say they'll come and then you don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:55:49-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I can't put an exact day on it from here, Diane. The crews are working through a long list after that storm, and I don't see the schedule from my desk. What I can do is flag it as urgent for the bus stop, and have the supervisor's office see it today. I'll note that you want a date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So there's no date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not one I can honestly give you right now. Let me ask the dispatcher while you're on. Can you hold a minute or two?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I can hold. I'll just sit here. [pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:56:38-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Sorry for the wait. So the dispatcher says the order will be in today's batch, and a crew is planned to look at the drain and clear it, probably in the next day or so. They said they'll try for tomorrow, but weather and other calls can move it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:57:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow. Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:57:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tuesday is the target. I'll write that in the notes, target Tuesday. If it's not cleared by then, call back and give them the order number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:57:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. There's a number. Let me get a pencil. [pause] I had one right here. Okay. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:57:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:57:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I have it. Pencil. I found it under the ukulele book."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:57:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The work order number is two-six-oh-one-one-two, dash, zero four. Two, six, zero, one, one, two, dash, zero, four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:57:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two, six, oh, one, one, two. Dash. Oh, four. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:57:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:57:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you. [pause] And in the meantime, the children. What do I do about the children? They're there again tomorrow morning. Seven thirty or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:58:04-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly, the best thing is what you're doing, getting it reported. If you see a car coming too fast and a kid in the road, call the police non-emergency line. And I'll mark in the order that it's right at a school bus stop so the crew knows the timing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:58:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I'd rather not have to call the police about a puddle. But it's not a puddle. It's a lake, almost."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:58:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hubcap deep isn't a puddle, no. I agree."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:58:42-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's just, um. [pause] I lost what I was saying. Oh. It's just that it's the same corner every time. You'd think somebody would have looked at it by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:58:56-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the notes too, that it holds water after storms, so whoever goes out can check if there's more going on than leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:59:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That would be good. That's all I wanted, really. For somebody to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:59:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's written down. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. That's all. Thank you, dear. I'll watch out the window tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:59:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Have a good afternoon, Diane. Enjoy the ukulele."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:59:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well. I'll try. Goodbye now."
    }
  ],
